@startuml
!include theme.iuml
allowmixing
title Small public API results — lexical preview, health and metadata
hide empty members
class "pydantic.BaseModel" as BaseModel <<external>>
class TokenResult {
  text: str
  category: str
}
class AnalysisResult {
  code_mixed_spans: list[str]
  verb_phrases: list[str]
}
class HealthResponse {
  status: ok
  mode: compiler
}
class MetadataResponse {
  categories: list[str]
  entry_types: list[str]
  lexical_categories: list[str]
  dataset_languages: list[str]
}
rectangle "backend.main.analyze(text, entries)\n<<function>>" as Analyze
rectangle "GET /api/health\nGET /api/metadata\n<<route functions>>" as Routes
TokenResult --|> BaseModel
AnalysisResult --|> BaseModel
HealthResponse --|> BaseModel
MetadataResponse --|> BaseModel
AnalysisResult "0..*" --> "0..*" TokenResult : tokens
Analyze ..> AnalysisResult : constructs from compiler output
Analyze ..> TokenResult : constructs each token DTO
Routes ..> HealthResponse
Routes ..> MetadataResponse
note bottom of AnalysisResult
  POST /api/analyze is a non-persisting lexical API.
  Franc Analyzer's visible Analyze action instead calls
  POST /api/analyzer/tests and retains a complete snapshot.
end note
legend bottom
  Source: backend/schemas.py. No selected authored methods: fields are the authored contract.
  BaseModel supplies serialization/validation; no invented constructors or business methods are listed.
  These DTOs are separate from strict TokenSnapshot and RecordedTest in analyzer_models.py.
endlegend
@enduml
